<title>UK: Libano Francaise prices $125 mln 5-yr Euro CD.</title>
<headline>Libano Francaise prices $125 mln 5-yr Euro CD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Euro deposit certificate issue, announced earlier by Indosuez Capital, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE LIBANO FRANCAISE S.A.L</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON     8.875     MATURITY    28.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE   EURO-CD	 ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+225 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
